This is a vendored copy of espressif/esp_tinyusb 1.7.6~2:
  https://github.com/espressif/idf-extra-components/tree/master/esp_tinyusb
Copyright Espressif Systems (Shanghai) CO LTD, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 (see components/esp_tinyusb/LICENSE).

Changes made to the original component (see CLAUDE.md for details):
  - Patched tusb_msc_storage.c (tinyusb_msc_storage_mount) to call the
    ESP-IDF 6.0 esp_vfs_fat_register() API, which takes a single
    esp_vfs_fat_conf_t struct instead of the previous separate
    base_path/drv/max_files arguments.
